ast sends fallout drifting down into the open hole."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you pour concrete walls and a roof, bury it under three feet of earth."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But the weight of the earth squeezes the walls until they crack."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you wrap the walls in thick steel and seal every gap."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a fallout shelter."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add stairs, a ceiling light and grass back on top."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a fallout shelter."}]}